cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the article and this repository."
title: "GS-LSC: least-squares collocation with a block Gauss-Seidel iterative solver"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation of three solvers for the least-squares collocation
  normal equations: standard (Cholesky) collocation, sequential collocation in
  the sense of Moritz and Tscherning, and a block Gauss-Seidel iteration whose
  storage is independent of the number of observations. Includes the Colorado
  test field of the 1-cm geoid experiment and the scripts reproducing the
  tables and figures of the paper.
